---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site, mailHref, addressLines } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Complaints procedure"
  path="/complaints/"
  updated="30 October 2026"
  description="How to raise a complaint with Apex Global Consulting Services, how we handle it, the timescales we work to and where to escalate if you are not satisfied."
>
  <p>We aim to provide an excellent service. If something has gone wrong, please tell us so we can put it right.</p>
  <h2>How to complain</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={mailHref}>{site.email}</a> or write to {site.legalName}, {addressLines.join(', ')}, with "Complaint" in the subject line. Please
    tell us what happened and what you would like us to do.
  </p>
  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>We acknowledge your complaint within 5 working days.</li>
    <li>A director not involved in the matter investigates it.</li>
    <li>We send a full written response within 8 weeks, or explain why we need longer.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>If you are not satisfied</h2>
  <p>
    You can refer the matter to our supervisory body: {site.compliance.amlSupervisorName}. Details of their complaints process
    are available on request.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
